# Ms. Marvel's trigger needs a spell Bot1 casts that targets a creature Bot1 controls. A Lightning Bolt at Bot2 (a player) and
# one at Bot2's Ornithopter (a creature, but an opponent's) put only themselves on the stack: no trigger, no card drawn.
# The positive control is the same Bolt at Ms. Marvel on turn 5: the stack is the Bolt and the trigger, and Bot1 draws.

